@central = http://localhost:5080

GET {{central}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Estado de la configuración inicial
GET {{central}}/api/auth/status
Accept: application/json

### Descripción del contrato (solo Development)
GET {{central}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Las rutas privadas requieren la cookie del login.
GET {{central}}/api/overview
Accept: application/json
